#====================================================================
# E263 — Tests must resolve runtime helpers from the installed layout
#====================================================================

id:                     E263
trigger_tool:           python|test_package|conan_test|runtime
phase:                  testing|runtime
error_signature:        FileNotFoundError:.*native_image_finalizer\.py|fake-java/bin/native_image_finalizer\.py|installed wrapper.*finalizer.*missing

severity:               2
category:               packaging|installed-layout|test-helper|python|native-image
match_keywords:         native-image, finalizer, installed layout, source tree, JAVA_HOME, libexec, test helper, package consumer
title:                  Package tests must resolve runtime helpers from the installed layout contract

root_cause:             A test helper assumes the wrapper and its support module are source-tree siblings. The installed package deliberately places the public companion under bin and the support module under JAVA_HOME/libexec, so the test passes in the source tree but fails against the packaged artifact.
affected_scope:         Packages whose source layout and installed runtime layout place launcher companions or support modules in different directories, especially tests that dynamically load helpers by deriving sibling paths.
verification_cmd:       Run the same transaction test against both the source-tree wrapper and the installed bin companion; require finalizer resolution from the sibling path for source tests and JAVA_HOME/libexec for package tests.

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           layout-aware-helper-resolution
rec_description:        Resolve the source-tree sibling first, then derive the installed runtime root through the wrapper's own JAVA_HOME contract and search its libexec support directory; report every searched path on failure.
rec_command:            Use wrapper._java_home(wrapper_path) and append libexec/graalvm-ohos/native_image_finalizer.py after the sibling candidate.
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               test-helper-change

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      explicit-runtime-helper-parameter
fallback_description:   Accept an explicit helper path from the package test driver when the production wrapper cannot expose its runtime-root derivation.
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          test-helper-change

forbid_1_pattern:       wrapper\.parent.*/.*native_image_finalizer\.py|copy.*native_image_finalizer.*bin
forbid_1_reason:        A sibling-only lookup encodes the source tree, while copying support code into bin changes the installed runtime contract solely to satisfy a test.
forbid_1_consequence:   Source tests pass but packaged consumer tests fail or the package gains duplicate, divergent support modules.

principles:             P010

causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             []
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

doc_file:               doc/E263.md
last_updated:           2026-08-08
source_event:           GraalVM 25.0.3 PR #3928 installed Native Image transaction-test layout failure

authors:                2301_80739235 <2047361658@qq.com>
